<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 5pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Indicate
by check mark whether the registrant is an emerging growth company as defined in Rule 405 of the Securities Act of 1933 (&#167;230.405
of this chapter) or Rule 12b-2 of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (&#167; 240.12b-2 of this chapter).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 5pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Emerging
growth company <span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240906__20240906_zFnZRgiJn2L5"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-09-06" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">[X]</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 5pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">If
an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for
complying with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act</span><span id="xdx_90F_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_dxH_c20240906__20240906_zawsb7uxN8w2">
[&#160;&#160;]&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; color: #333333"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

